osmnxr-core
===========

osmnxr-core is the compute core of osmnxr, a port to R of OSMnx, the Python
library created and maintained by Geoff Boeing
(https://github.com/gboeing/osmnx). The street-network model this crate serves
(topology simplification, intersection consolidation, bearings and orientation
metrics) follows OSMnx. Please cite:

  Boeing, G. (2025). Modeling and Analyzing Urban Networks and Amenities with
  OSMnx. Geographical Analysis, 57(4), 567-577. doi:10.1111/gean.70009

